<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan passes on 54,000T U.S. corn/soy tender.</title>
<headline>Taiwan passes on 54,000T U.S. corn/soy tender.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's CK group passed on Thursday's tender for a combined shipment of 54,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn and soybeans due high offer prices, traders said.</p>
<p>The CK Group comprises Chia Hsin Flour Feed and Vegetable Oil Corp and some buyers from Taiwan's southern port city of Kaohsiung.</p>
